sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Staff
    participant L as Livewire (browser)
    participant W as ServerIndex (server)

    U->>L: types "alpha"
    L->>W: update q=alpha (slow, 3 s)
    U->>L: types "beta"
    L->>L: new wire:model.live action supersedes the one in flight
    L->>W: update q=beta
    W-->>L: results for beta
    L->>L: render beta, URL becomes ?q=beta
    W-->>L: results for alpha (arrives late)
    Note over L: the superseded response is thrown away
